 ### RefSR-NeRF
-RefSR-NeRF is a reference-guided super-resolution neural radiation field framework combining NeRF and RefSR-CNN to achieve high-quality new perspective synthesis while balancing memory and speed [S3]. In Stage 1, it modifies NeRF sampling strategy to adopt patch ray sampling on the high-resolution input image to obtain a low-resolution image. RefSR-CNN yields feature maps from the detail-dominant information module and the degradation-dominant information module. These feature maps are fused to reconstruct a high-resolution image [S3]. On the NeRF-LLFF data set, PSNR is nearly one point higher than the best paper [S3].
